{"event": "turn", "session_id": "0239ef1b54dc4069a5782af947079e5c", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:29:23.697920+00:00", "message": "介绍绿茶的加工特点", "resolved_question": "介绍绿茶的加工特点", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 14.583, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5680, "output_tokens": 735, "response": {"answer": "绿茶加工的核心特点如下：\n\n**关键工艺：快速加热灭活酶**\n绿茶加工首先对鲜叶快速加热，使酶失活，这是形成绿茶品质的关键步骤。之后可能包括揉捻、做形或粉碎、干燥等工序。具体加热方式和成品形状因产地和产品而异。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n\n**与红茶的根本区别：不刻意氧化**\n绿茶与红茶最本质的加工差异在于：绿茶不经过红茶工艺中那种有意的通气/氧化（发酵）过程，即“几乎不氧化或不刻意氧化”。（来源：ISO 20715:2023；Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）\n\n**补充说明**\n- 茶树品种与茶类是两个不同概念：同一品种用不同加工方法可制成不同茶类，因此品种本身不决定最终茶类与香气，加工方式同样重要。（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）\n- 关于“发酵”一词，红茶加工中的“发酵”通常指酶促氧化，与微生物发酵不同；若您听到“绿茶是否发酵”，需先明确指哪一种过程。（来源：Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）\n\n以上为加工特点介绍。如需了解具体某款绿茶商品的价格、库存或风味，请告知商品名称，我再为您查询。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "介绍绿茶的加工特点", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "介绍绿茶的加工特点", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "介绍绿茶的加工特点", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "Introduce the processing characteristics of green tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "介绍绿茶的加工特点 | green tea processing", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "绿茶加工工艺特点介绍", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["65", "68", "81", "78", "77"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
